ngerous situations?</br><span class=\"bullet\"></span>\nSpeculate about the past. Include sentences that use modals like could, might and must.<br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button. </span></span>\n</br></br><span class=\"strong\">My Autobiography</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "You are done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Time to review your autobiography.</span>\n</br>\nDid you include the following in your autobiography?\n<ul><li>\nInformation about where you were born and your early life</li><li>\nExplain how you entered into show business</li><li>\nModals to speculate about the past</li></ul>\n\nRead the autobiography aloud to a partner.\n</br>\nProofread your autobiography for grammar, spelling and punctuation errors.\n</br>\n\nClick the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span> button to save your work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "grading_chart", "grading_contents": {"body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", 