! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le15ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le15ob08re2img02.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le15ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn9le15ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "<p>Many people say that Harry Houdini was the most famous magician of all time. Today, when people hear the name Houdini, they think of the ability to escape from any restraint or difficult situation.</p> Houdini's early childhood was full of mystery. His original name was Ehrich Weiss. He was born on March 24, 1874, in Budapest. When Houdini was four years old, he was taken to the United States by his parents. His life could have been very different if his family had stayed in Europe.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le15ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "<p>It was often claimed by Houdini that he was born in Wisconsin. Historians, however, later concluded that he was born in Hungary. Even today, people from Appleton claim that their city was Houdini's birthplace. Houdini might have wanted to hide his immigrant origins.</p>Houdini had a poor childhood. The Weiss children had to work from an early age. By the time he was eight years old, Ehrich was already selling newspapers and working as a shoeshine boy. It must have been a challenging time for the family. Eventually Ehrich ended up in New York, when he was about 13 years old. As a teenager in New York, Ehrich became interested in magic. He may have felt that this was another way of making a living.  Calling himself Ehrich the Great, he began performing card tricks and other simple tricks for money. His career started to take off.", "time": "35000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le15ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "One day, he read a book that changed his life. The book, <span class=\"italic\">The Memoirs of Robert-Houdin</span>, was written by one of the world's greatest magicians. Ehrich was so influenced by what he read that he changed his name to Houdini. Little did he know that this up and coming star would eventually become even more famous than Robert-Houdin.", "time": "92000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn9le15ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> How do you speculate about the past?</span>", "time": "53000", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> Which modals do you use when speculating about the past?</span>", "time": "76000", "id": 2}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}